Hecks.hecksagon "Plan" do
  # DDD dependency replication : Story.unresolved_dep_count is the local twin of the old
  # cross-aggregate dependency gate. When a dependency story reaches a terminal state
  # (StoryApproved -> done, StoryCancelled), this adapter fans DecUnresolvedDeps out over
  # Story.DependentsOf(dep={id}) — every story whose dependencies list contains it. The
  # query is aggregate-local (contains where op) ; no aggregate reads a sibling. {id} =
  # the resolving story ref ; record-first the matched dependent story's ref.

end
